      "writtenOn": "2025-09-27T01:39:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This does sound like an RWLock as I mentioned before. Do you think we could factor it into one? Or not because there are multiple mutexes involved?\n\nI know we would take the R lock more often, but I think it\u0027s worth it for structural correctness.",
      "revId": "897c19bc5c689c941c526ded60ba29ea6d39ee2f",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
